  "story": {
    "day": 58,
    "title": "A Morning Surprise",
    "sentences": [
      "Yesterday, Kaya decided to go to a restaurant by the station for breakfast.",
      "Her parent, a Chinese math teacher, joined her after a morning walk.",
      "Her father usually ate healthy bread rolls, but he wanted meat today.",
      "He ordered a spicy beef taco as a special treat for them.",
      "Next, Kaya saw a famous soccer player who drank juice at their table.",
      "\"He's very fast on the field,\" her father whispered.",
      "The player talked to a teammate about an interesting television program.",
      "Kaya wanted to learn more about the team and its history.",
      "So, she did a short interview with him for her English homework.",
      "Finally, she took a photo of these friendly players to show her classmates."
    ]
  }
}